error[RB0319]: call `get` returns `int`, so `reply … done` needs a value
  --> RB0319-bad-reply.road:10:12
   |
 5 |   call get() -> int ! Busy
   |        --- declared here
...
10 |     on get reply call done
   |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: write `reply call done <int>`

error[RB0319]: call `put` returns nothing, so its `reply … done` has no value
  --> RB0319-bad-reply.road:11:28
   |
 6 |   call put()
   |        --- declared here
...
11 |     on put reply call done 1
   |                            ^
   |
   = help: write `reply call done`, or declare what it returns: `call put(…) -> <type>`

